lemma PanEliteFe : ∃ (U:FrameK (Fin (θ u))→ₗ[ℂ] FrameK (Fin (θ u))) (C:ℝ),0≤C∧∀ x, LiPaJ B0 R u (U x)=Φκ (LiPaJ B0 R u x)∧LoomK (U x) ≤ LoomK x*C:=by
 let S:= Tsava p B0 M R u pu
 let W:= ThreadΨ B0 u R; let V:= Φκ ∘ W
 have hp(i:Fin (θ u)): ΓProj u.val (V i)=V i:=by unfold V W; rw [Function.comp_apply,Spin_gateFe,S.saturated,if_pos (S.ray i)]
 choose Z h using fun i=> S.coframe (V i) (hp i)
 let U:=ArchBuildJ Z; let C:= ∑ i:Fin (θ u), ‖V i‖
 refine ⟨U,C*|G|,mul_nonneg (sum_nonneg fun i _=> norm_nonneg _) (abs_nonneg _),fun x=>?_⟩
 have hu:LiPaJ B0 R u (U x)=Woof x V:=by
   change LiPaJ B0 R u (∑ i:Fin (θ u), x i • Z i)= ∑ i:Fin (θ u), x i • V i; rw [map_sum]; simp_rw [map_smul]; apply sum_congr rfl; intro i _; exact congrArg (x i • ·) (h i).symm -- orientation
 rw[hu]
 constructor
 · change ∑ i:Fin (θ u), x i • (ZinFe (chipUFe gk) (W i))=ZinFe (chipUFe gk) (∑ i:Fin (θ u),x i • W i); rw [map_sum]; simp_rw [map_smul]
 refine (S.brake (U x)).trans ?_; change G * ‖LiPaJ B0 R u (U x)‖≤ _; rw[hu]; refine le_trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (le_abs_self G) (norm_nonneg _)) ?_; refine le_trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (woof_cost x (fun (i: Fin (θ u))=> show ‖V i‖≤ C from single_le_sum (fun i _=> norm_nonneg _) (mem_univ i))) (abs_nonneg _)) (by nlinarith)
